---
// Original cast for the closing banner (all hand-drawn flat polygons, no reference art).
// One SVG in "stage" units: 1024 × 484 = the reference character block; ground (footer edge) at y = 472.
// The middle character sits on the edge and its legs hang below it (overflow is visible on purpose).
//   stack  – three server slabs on legs            tab    – lanky bot with a browser window for a head (waves)
//   glitch – small pixel ghost, hovering (click)   hatch  – faceted chick still wearing its eggshell (tuft sways)
//   crane  – long-legged angular bird              bracket – squat </> critter with bracket arms
//   orbit  – hovering satellite drone
---

